        "title": "The chart below shows the number of magazines sold per person in five countries in 2000 and 2010, with projected sales for 2020. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make a comparison where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S9e0d2O6golVtAxgx2Ol5t2ogje\"><strong><em>The chart below shows the number of magazines sold per person in five countries in 2000 and 2010, with projected sales for 2020. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make a comparison where relevant.</em></strong></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Magazine Sales in Five Countries: 2000&ndash;2020</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SaSKdM1JpoWdT8xr5WclDARzg0d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Magazine Sales in Five Countries: 2000&ndash;2020 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả số lượng tạp ch&iacute; được b&aacute;n ra tr&ecirc;n b&igrave;nh qu&acirc;n đầu người ở năm quốc gia v&agrave;o năm 2000 v&agrave; 2010, với doanh số dự kiến cho năm 2020.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xhs7d86SRoM5VWxMeeHl2lASgmc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>Paraphrase đề Magazine Sales in Five Countries: 2000&ndash;2020 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: số tạp ch&iacute; được b&aacute;n ra - b&igrave;nh qu&acirc;n đầu người - 5 quốc gia - 2000 đến 2020.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D9n2dT6reoUXRNx42urlLISBgH9\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IGyjdCCmNoNsJMxOIIblTD7wgPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>A, B, v&agrave; C giảm || D v&agrave; E tăng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RhBGdssNdoh7nBxbXBElrx25g2e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>quốc gia B duy tr&igrave; doanh số cao nhất || quốc gia E thấp hơn đ&aacute;ng kể so với c&aacute;c quốc gia kh&aacute;c.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SX0BduN3Colr0qxzGQjl2lytg0e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KNu5d9AfEoGOYfxliXmldIZqgqc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Quốc gia A v&agrave; B</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KNu5d9AfEoGOYfxliXmldIZqgqc\">Theo<strong> Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVlsdV8hTowVlvxFp86ldVrCgig\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2000 </strong><em>(</em><em>B </em><em>dẫn đầu với 50 tạp ch&iacute; b&igrave;nh qu&acirc;n đầu người, </em><em>cao hơn một ch&uacute;t</em><em> so với quốc gia A với 48 tạp ch&iacute;).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F5VUdvoXhohuRexaCbJlctmUg6g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của quốc gia B </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>giảm dần</strong></em><em> về 47 tạp ch&iacute; năm 2010, v&agrave; được dự kiến sẽ </em><em>giảm tiếp về</em><em> 45 tạp ch&iacute; năm 2020).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DxIOdl8bDohvE0xbGdVlWdPMg0G\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của quốc gia A</strong> <em>(</em><em><strong>giảm đ&aacute;ng kể </strong>hơn</em><em> xuống 44 tạp ch&iacute; v&agrave;o 2010, dự kiến sẽ c&ograve;n 37 tạp ch&iacute; v&agrave;o 2020).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SCSwdax9tomUUSxefRElcRiTgHc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: </strong><strong>Quốc </strong><strong>gia C, D, v&agrave; E</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SCSwdax9tomUUSxefRElcRiTgHc\">Theo<strong> Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SCSwdax9tomUUSxefRElcRiTgHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NPMcdlTPGodHsjxB7dDlWwAqgnv\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1)&nbsp;<strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2000 </strong><em>(quốc gia C<strong> </strong></em><em>bắt đầu với</em><em> 36 tạp ch&iacute; b&igrave;nh qu&acirc;n đầu người, trong khi quốc gia D v&agrave; E ghi nhận </em><em>con số thấp hơn nhiều</em><em>, lần lượt l&agrave; 18 v&agrave; 4).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nkgude6GXot29qxJJmPlsfJMgSd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của quốc gia C </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>giảm nhẹ</strong></em><em> về 34 tạp ch&iacute; v&agrave;o 2010 v&agrave; 33 v&agrave;o 2020).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NRDEd5fMEobZfux5MDLlk7ZCgKd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của quốc gia D</strong> <em>(</em><em><strong>tăng đều</strong></em><em>&nbsp;l&ecirc;n 20 tạp ch&iacute; v&agrave;o 2010, dự kiến sẽ đạt 23 tạp ch&iacute; v&agrave;o 2020).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MMWwdhpIJoqm4IxMqpHl4xnigag\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của quốc gia E </strong><em>(<strong>tương đối ổn định </strong>trong suốt giai đoạn, <strong>dao động nhẹ</strong> từ 4 đến 7 tạp ch&iacute;).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOGCdDfzMo4b0vxNcTDlMZwkgW6\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DKR6dLMaeoXxeTxrXRSlEEvNg0c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y, nếu kh&ocirc;ng muốn lặp lại từ <strong>\"project\"</strong> qu&aacute; nhiều th&igrave; m&igrave;nh cũng c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng từ <strong>\"expect\"</strong> hay \"<strong>forecast</strong>\" để chỉ h&agrave;nh động <strong>dự b&aacute;o</strong> nh&eacute;.\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFshdTv7woYfaLxeBzTlkRkOgub\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LoI0dyrlmoSv81xGbvPldwHEgie\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Country B then experienced a gradual decline to 47 magazines in 2010 and <strong>was</strong> <strong>forecast</strong> to fall further to 45 units by 2020.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SmwidyNbwo8LN4xNqkmlWxg7gBe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Meanwhile, country A saw a more significant decrease, dropping to 44 magazines per capita in 2010 and <strong>was</strong> <strong>expected</strong> to reach 37 units by the end of the period.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 560,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W4bvdOusuowZ59xojXulCO07g9I\">The bar chart illustrates the number of magazines purchased per capita in five different countries over a 20-year period, from 2000 to 2020, with the last year showing projected figures.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13827,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 561,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RDhgdqmUho5tr1xqIzylA30Bgdd\">Overall, three countries (A, B and C) showed a declining trend in magazine sales throughout the period, while the remaining two nations experienced growth in their figures. Moreover, country B consistently maintained the highest sales figures among all countries, while country E remained significantly lower than the others throughout the period.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13827,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 562,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PEF2dXqb5o0jllxQOLblgCDAg3f\">Looking at the countries with higher sales figures, in 2000, country B led with 50 magazines per person, slightly higher than country A, at 48 units. Country B then experienced a gradual decline to 47 magazines in 2010 and was forecast to fall further to 45 units by 2020. Meanwhile, country A saw a more significant decrease, dropping to 44 magazines per capita in 2010 and was expected to reach 37 units by the end of the period.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13827,
            "is_toggle_on": true
